        "original_id": "ed6dee7c-b2c0-5943-9ed6-20e803aa7b98",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Buchan trap, plumbing trap\n- Concepts: water seal, sewer gas prevention, one-way passage of waste\n\nFacts:\n- In plumbing, a trap is a device with a bent shape that captures water while allowing waste to pass through.\n- A plumbing trap uses the captured water to prevent sewer gases from entering buildings.\n- A Buchan trap keeps water in the pipe, which prevents anything from passing from the opposite direction.",
